Why must we serve

264
00:26:21,719 --> 00:26:25,346
Because we love our land

265
00:26:25,430 --> 00:26:29,224
And we want it to be free , to be free

266
00:26:42,691 --> 00:26:44,442
Are you okay ?

267
00:26:44,984 --> 00:26:47,068
I 'm exhausted .

268
00:26:48,194 --> 00:26:50,112
Let me help you carry this .

269
00:26:50,195 --> 00:26:53,781
Wow , since we can bring our maids to the army

270
00:26:53,864 --> 00:26:57,200
I should 've told mine to come along to carry my field pack .

271
00:26:57,283 --> 00:27:00,035
Dragon , can you shut up ?

272
00:27:00,410 --> 00:27:03,204
Why should I shut up ? I 'll speak as I please .

273
00:27:03,287 --> 00:27:06,289
I 'm not a weakling who does all your bidding .

274
00:27:06,372 --> 00:27:09,333
Darn . Do you think this is your grandfather 's camp ?

275
00:27:10,125 --> 00:27:12,126
This is really his grandfather 's camp .

276
00:27:12,209 --> 00:27:15,045
His grandfather used to be the camp commander here .

277
00:27:15,128 --> 00:27:17,463
Darn . What 's your point ?

278
00:27:17,546 --> 00:27:19,631
So what if he 's born with a silver spoon in his mouth ?

279
00:27:21,382 --> 00:27:23,800
- What ? - I doubt he can carry on .

280
00:27:26,177 --> 00:27:28,970
This is what you call a sissy . He can 't even roll with the punches .

281
00:27:29,053 --> 00:27:30,429
What the hell .

282
00:27:53,986 --> 00:27:57,321
Auntie , it 's getting late . You should go home .

283
00:27:58,530 --> 00:28:00,407
Be careful .

284
00:28:17,042 --> 00:28:20,169
I can 't locate Tan and Jeremy . Both of you , wait here for them .

285
00:28:20,253 --> 00:28:22,879
I 'm going to find Sergeant Kuah , all right ?

286
00:28:28,007 --> 00:28:31,260
What 's his problem ? He 's being overzealous .

287
00:28:31,718 --> 00:28:35,304
That 's not being overzealous . It 's called bootlicking .

288
00:28:35,387 --> 00:28:40,140
It 's a skill which the nerds have hone to perfection .

289
00:28:41,057 --> 00:28:43,726
I heard his father is a full colonel

290
00:28:43,809 --> 00:28:46,478
and his elder brother was a best recruit

291
00:28:46,561 --> 00:28:48,270
awarded with the Sword of Honour .

292
00:28:48,354 --> 00:28:50,188
His family is really outstanding .

293
00:28:50,897 --> 00:28:54,608
And what 's your point again ? Unlike you , I 'm not a busybody .

294
00:28:57,151 --> 00:28:59,402
What 's taking them so long ?

295
00:29:03,447 --> 00:29:05,615
I hope they 're fine .

296
00:29:05,698 --> 00:29:06,740
What do you mean ?

297
00:29:07,574 --> 00:29:08,742
What 's the time now ?

298
00:29:08,825 --> 00:29:11,452
It 's eleven ...

299
00:29:13,453 --> 00:29:19,207
Was that 23.59 story true ?

300
00:29:19,498 --> 00:29:22,417
Do you think I would joke about something like this ?

301
00:29:25,878 --> 00:29:28,129
Have you heard about the story on this island ?

302
00:29:28,212 --> 00:29:29,630
What story ?

303
00:29:30,672 --> 00:29:35,467
On this island , there was a very powerful medium

304
00:29:35,550 --> 00:29:37,760
who could communicate with the dead .

305
00:29:37,843 --> 00:29:41,763
And it was even said that she could control their spirits .

306
00:30:08,905 --> 00:30:14,116
On that night , she gave birth to a deformed baby .

307
00:30:15,617 --> 00:30:20,996
It was said that the baby was possessed by the spirit she summoned .

308
00:30:21,538 --> 00:30:23,914
That must 've been terrible .

309
00:30:23,998 --> 00:30:26,124
The worst had yet to come .

310
00:30:26,207 --> 00:30:29,168
Do you know what the baby grew into ?

311
00:30:32,878 --> 00:30:34,213
Yes .

312
00:30:45,428 --> 00:30:46,763
Freak !

313
00:30:46,847 --> 00:30:49,893
- Get lost . - Go to hell .

314
00:30:49,976 --> 00:30:52,563
Go away ! Get back to where you came from .

315
00:30:54,441 --> 00:30:56,110
What happened to her subsequently ?

316
00:30:56,194 --> 00:30:57,487
I don 't know .

317
00:30:57,571 --> 00:31:01,910
Some people said she died , but her spirit lingers on the island .

318
00:31:04,623 --> 00:31:05,666
This island ?

319
00:31:11,967 --> 00:31:13,260
Did you hear that ?

320
00:31:16,724 --> 00:31:18,560
Did you hear that ?

321
00:31:25,528 --> 00:31:28,199
Namo Amitabha .

322
00:31:28,282 --> 00:31:30,160
- What are you chanting ? - Namo Amitabha .

323
00:31:30,243 --> 00:31:33,164
- What are you chanting ? Teach me . - Namo Amitabha !

324
00:31:33,874 --> 00:31:35,417
Namo Amitabha .

325
00:31:35,501 --> 00:31:39,715
- Namo Amitabha . - Namo Amitabha .

326
00:31:39,799 --> 00:31:41,635
What are you doing ?

327
00:31:43,513 --> 00:31:46,726
What the hell . You freaked us out .

328
00:31:46,809 --> 00:31:48,812
- Where is Tan ? - Wasn 't he with you ?

329
00:31:49,521 --> 00:31:50,773
I thought he was with you guys .

330
00:31:55,614 --> 00:31:57,700
Put on your helmet ! Where is Tan ?

331
00:31:57,783 --> 00:32:00,663
- He went missing . - Missing ? Where was he last seen ?

332
00:32:00,746 --> 00:32:02,499
I think it was near the fourth checkpoint .

333
00:32:02,582 --> 00:32:03,834
Shit .

334
00:32:03,917 --> 00:32:06,755
Fourth checkpoint ? Was he carrying the talisman I gave him ?

335
00:32:06,838 --> 00:32:08,591
No .

336
00:32:08,674 --> 00:32:12,054
Come on , let 's go look for him . Come on , follow me .

337
00:32:32,042 --> 00:32:34,378
- Sergeant ! - What is it ?

338
00:32:36,465 --> 00:32:38,092
It 's a field pack .

339
00:32:39,594 --> 00:32:41,222
Okay , recruits , listen up .

340
00:32:41,305 --> 00:32:44,268
The four of you , go look for Tan , but don 't wander too far away .

341
00:32:44,351 --> 00:32:46,688
We 'll gather here in five minutes .

342
00:32:47,314 --> 00:32:48,983
- Yes , Sergeant . - Yes , Sergeant .

343
00:32:58,914 --> 00:32:59,957
Shit .

344
00:33:00,750 --> 00:33:03,838
Shit . I can 't see anything !

345
00:33:05,382 --> 00:33:07,385
Okay , recruits , listen up .

346
00:33:07,468 --> 00:33:10,598
Find your buddy and put your left hand on his left shoulder .

347
00:33:11,098 --> 00:33:13,894
Over here .

348
00:33:15,313 --> 00:33:16,857
Over here .

349
00:33:17,524 --> 00:33:18,901
Okay , number off !

350
00:33:18,985 --> 00:33:20,070
One .

351
00:33:20,529 --> 00:33:21,739
Two .

352
00:33:21,822 --> 00:33:22,949
Three .

353
00:33:23,032 --> 00:33:24,201
Four .

354
00:33:24,284 --> 00:33:26,538
Five .

355
00:33:27,581 --> 00:33:28,624
Five ?

356
00:33:38,597 --> 00:33:41,852
What 's going on ? What 's going on ?

357
00:33:41,935 --> 00:33:45,565
Get up . What 's going on ?

358
00:33:45,649 --> 00:33:47,276
I saw him .

359
00:33:47,360 --> 00:33:49,112
Who did you see ?

360
00:33:49,863 --> 00:33:51,657
- Tan . - Tan ?

361
00:33:51,741 --> 00:33:54,286
Everybody , go and find Tan !

362
00:33:56,373 --> 00:33:58,334
Go .

363
00:34:34,136 --> 00:34:35,805
Tan .

364
00:34:42,440 --> 00:34:44,234
Sergeant !

365
00:35:00,508 --> 00:35:02,678
Kuah , about your report

366
00:35:02,761 --> 00:35:05,765
I don 't understand what you 're trying to tell me .

367
00:35:05,849 --> 00:35:07,977
Sorry , Sir , I know that I can 't write good English .

368
00:35:08,060 --> 00:35:10,272
Yes . We all know that , but that 's not the point .

369
00:35:11,106 --> 00:35:16,990
Based on what you wrote , " Someone saw Tan standing behind him

370
00:35:17,073 --> 00:35:21,705
and ten seconds more , find his body near a tree . "

371
00:35:21,789 --> 00:35:23,416
- Is that right ? - Yes , Sir .

372
00:35:23,499 --> 00:35:27,964
That night , I had a feeling something was out there .

373
00:35:28,048 --> 00:35:29,508
What do you mean by something ?

374
00:35:29,592 --> 00:35:32,137
I don 't know what exactly it was , but it was something like a ghost

375
00:35:32,221 --> 00:35:34,724
a demon , a spirit or , as the Hokkiens put it

376
00:35:34,808 --> 00:35:36,310
something unholy .

377
00:35:36,393 --> 00:35:38,354
Kuah , do you know what you 're talking about ?

378
00:35:39,106 --> 00:35:40,942
Are you blaming Recruit Tan 's accident

379
00:35:41,025 --> 00:35:43,946
on some kind of ghost , on the supernatural ?

380
00:35:44,697 --> 00:35:47,117
I 'm not sure if it was a ghost that killed Tan .

381
00:35:47,201 --> 00:35:49,370
But I can confirm that his death wasn 't an accident .

382
00:35:49,454 --> 00:35:51,332
If it wasn 't an accident , it 's your fault .

383
00:35:51,791 --> 00:35:52,834
My fault ?

384
00:35:52,917 --> 00:35:56,798
Kuah , your responsibility was to keep the recruits safe .

385
00:35:56,881 --> 00:35:57,925
You didn 't do a good job .

386
00:35:58,843 --> 00:36:02,264
Do you know how hard it is to look into the parents ' eyes

387
00:36:02,348 --> 00:36:04,977
and to tell them that their son died in our care ?

388
00:36:05,060 --> 00:36:06,604
In our care !

389
00:36:08,106 --> 00:36:09,733
Anyway , I did my best .

390
00:36:09,817 --> 00:36:11,695
I even brought them talismans from a temple .

391
00:36:11,778 --> 00:36:13,739
Would other sergeants do that for the recruits ?

392
00:36:14,282 --> 00:36:16,410
Giving the recruits talismans couldn 't have kept them safe .

393
00:36:16,702 --> 00:36:18,204
Making sure that they were physically well

394
00:36:18,288 --> 00:36:19,372
doing proper headcounts

395
00:36:19,456 --> 00:36:20,958
and making sure they had enough water to drink

396
00:36:21,042 --> 00:36:22,585
should 've been the way to keep the recruits safe .

397
00:36:22,669 --> 00:36:26,216
I did the headcount and there was an extra recruit . So ?

398
00:36:26,299 --> 00:36:27,760
If there was an extra recruit , that was your fault .

399
00:36:27,843 --> 00:36:30,013
Don 't blame it on the supernatural .

400
00:36:33,017 --> 00:36:37,023
Okay . Anyway , I know I 've done what was necessary .

401
00:36:37,107 --> 00:36:38,358
If the army doesn 't believe in the supernatural

402
00:36:38,442 --> 00:36:40,862
why isn 't there any training on Thursday nights ?

403
00:36:40,946 --> 00:36:44,200
And why aren 't we allowed to walk through Muslim cemeteries

404
00:36:44,284 --> 00:36:46,245
during the route march ?

405
00:36:46,328 --> 00:36:49,374
Just because we don 't do Thursday night route marches

406
00:36:49,458 --> 00:36:52,212
just because we don 't walk through Muslim cemeteries

407
00:36:52,295 --> 00:36:53,965
does that mean we believe in the supernatural ?

408
00:36:55,175 --> 00:36:56,552
You 're kind of simple-minded , aren 't you ?

409
00:36:56,635 --> 00:36:58,429
I don 't know what you mean .

410
00:36:58,513 --> 00:37:01,267
I just know that one recruit has died and I can 't afford to lose another .

411
00:37:01,350 --> 00:37:03,854
In that case , make sure that doesn 't happen again .

412
00:37:03,937 --> 00:37:05,857
Give the recruits half a day off .

413
00:37:05,940 --> 00:37:08,527
If any one of them is still affected psychologically

414
00:37:08,611 --> 00:37:11,615
send him to the medical officer . Do you understand ?

415
00:37:15,663 --> 00:37:16,748
Yes , Sir !

416
00:37:39,906 --> 00:37:40,950
Hey , bro .

417
00:37:42,410 --> 00:37:44,413
Have a bite .

418
00:37:47,167 --> 00:37:49,295
Stop brooding over it .

419
00:37:49,379 --> 00:37:53,217
It was just an accident . No one expected it to happen .

420
00:37:54,386 --> 00:37:55,930
It wasn 't an accident .

421
00:37:56,639 --> 00:37:57,724
What do you mean ?

422
00:37:58,058 --> 00:38:01,354
Like I said many times , I really saw Tan 's spirit .

423
00:38:02,105 --> 00:38:05,068
Tan 's death was definitely not an accident .

424
00:38:05,151 --> 00:38:07,405
I found it strange that

425
00:38:07,488 --> 00:38:10,493
all our torchlights went out at the same time .

426
00:38:11,786 --> 00:38:14,916
I ran a check . All of them were out of juice .

427
00:38:14,999 --> 00:38:16,042
I just changed the batteries .

428
00:38:17,086 --> 00:38:19,631
Do you think that extra headcount was normal ?

429
00:38:20,382 --> 00:38:23,512
Perhaps we panicked and counted wrongly .

430
00:38:25,139 --> 00:38:26,558
You kept saying that you saw Tan 's spirit .

431
00:38:26,641 --> 00:38:27,935
But why didn 't the rest of us see him ?

432
00:38:28,018 --> 00:38:30,397
How the hell would I know ?

433
00:38:31,774 --> 00:38:33,735
Why do you refuse to believe that I saw Tan 's spirit ?

434
00:38:35,070 --> 00:38:36,656
That 's because you caused his death

435
00:38:36,989 --> 00:38:38,700
and you 're afraid he 'll come back to take revenge on you , right ?

436
00:38:38,784 --> 00:38:39,952
- Say that again if you dare ! - What ?

437
00:38:40,036 --> 00:38:42,831
- Try saying that again ! - Calm down , guys . Cut it out .

438
00:38:42,915 --> 00:38:44,876
That 's enough !

439
00:38:45,502 --> 00:38:48,590
We 'll know if it was an accident after the investigation .

440
00:38:48,673 --> 00:38:52,470
What 's the use of an investigation if they 're blind to the truth ?

441
00:39:46,382 --> 00:39:49,011
Listen , I 'm warning you guys now .

442
00:39:49,094 --> 00:39:51,348
It 's better to put coins under the bed .

443
00:39:51,431 --> 00:39:53,309
Otherwise , if your bed shakes at night

444
00:39:53,392 --> 00:39:55,312
it 's not my problem .

445
00:42:15,015 --> 00:42:16,058
Tan .

446
00:42:20,023 --> 00:42:21,817
I 'm sorry .

447
00:42:24,905 --> 00:42:27,325
Tan ?

448
00:42:28,910 --> 00:42:29,995
Tan .

449
00:42:30,705 --> 00:42:32,249
Tan ?

450
00:43:28,539 --> 00:43:29,624
Room .

451
00:43:32,294 --> 00:43:34,005
At ease .

452
00:43:43,561 --> 00:43:45,689
Your mum just called .

453
00:43:46,982 --> 00:43:49,111
She informed us that your dad had just passed away .

454
00:43:50,738 --> 00:43:53,158
Do you need compassionate leave ?

455
00:43:54,827 --> 00:43:56,455
That won 't be necessary .

456
00:43:56,997 --> 00:43:58,708
Are you sure ?

457
00:44:00,168 --> 00:44:02,589
You don 't have to go for the morning training later .

458
00:44:03,590 --> 00:44:05,384
I can manage .

459
00:44:05,676 --> 00:44:07,429
Are you okay ?

460
00:44:24,495 --> 00:44:26,874
- What 's the matter ? - I 'm not feeling well .

461
00:44:26,957 --> 00:44:29,085
Can you book out to visit me ?

462
00:44:29,378 --> 00:44:30,880
This is an army camp .

463
00:44:30,963 --> 00:44:33,050
Do you think I can book out at my whim and fancy ?

464
00:44:33,133 --> 00:44:35,052
Just make an exception this time .

465
00:44:35,136 --> 00:44:36,179
No way .

466
00:44:49,615 --> 00:44:51,243
Tan .

467
00:44:53,079 --> 00:44:54,998
I hope you can rest in peace .

468
00:44:57,335 --> 00:44:59,839
We 're in different worlds now .

469
00:45:01,257 --> 00:45:05,388
I hope you can be more relaxed over there .

470
00:45:06,265 --> 00:45:08,351
Don 't come back for us .

471
00:45:12,774 --> 00:45:14,234
Tan .

472
00:45:15,737 --> 00:45:17,489
I 'm sorry .

473
00:45:19,909 --> 00:45:22,497
I didn 't mean to bully you .

474
00:45:25,543 --> 00:45:27,629
Like you , I always got bullied

475
00:45:29,006 --> 00:45:31,134
when I was a kid .

476
00:45:31,802 --> 00:45:37,769
I thought that if I bullied you , you 'd become stronger and more manly .

477
00:45:39,521 --> 00:45:41,399
But now , I know I was wrong .

478
00:45:42,609 --> 00:45:44,737
I 've realised how silly I was .

479
00:45:46,657 --> 00:45:48,826
Can you please forgive me ?

480
00:46:00,594 --> 00:46:02,096
What ?

481
00:46:14,072 --> 00:46:16,200
I 've reached my limit .

482
00:46:18,036 --> 00:46:20,915
Darn . You 're really weak .

483
00:46:26,173 --> 00:46:28,384
Lim , let me ask you .

484
00:46:29,219 --> 00:46:31,555
Does my mouth really stink ?

485
00:46:33,725 --> 00:46:35,603
Go to hell .

486
00:46:38,983 --> 00:46:40,402
Who are you ?

487
00:46:43,281 --> 00:46:44,324
Jeremy ?

488
00:46:46,118 --> 00:46:47,662
Jeremy .

489
00:46:51,877 --> 00:46:52,920
Are you okay ?

490
00:46:53,546 --> 00:46:55,340
- Did you see her ? - Who ?

491
00:46:55,423 --> 00:46:57,009
Did you see her ?

492
00:46:57,093 --> 00:46:59,596
It 's that woman . She was there on the night Tan died .

493
00:47:00,013 --> 00:47:02,058
Don 't go in there , Jeremy !

494
00:47:04,353 --> 00:47:05,897
Did Tan 's spirit come back for you ?

495
00:47:08,651 --> 00:47:10,612
It was just a dream .

496
00:47:11,405 --> 00:47:12,615
You can 't deny their existence

497
00:47:12,699 --> 00:47:14,493
just because you don 't believe in them .

498
00:47:17,247 --> 00:47:18,916
So you can confirm their existence

499
00:47:18,999 --> 00:47:21,086
just because you believe in them ?

500
00:48:35,110 --> 00:48:36,821
Chester ?

501
00:48:37,238 --> 00:48:38,824
Chester ?

502
00:48:39,325 --> 00:48:40,869
Chester ?

503
00:48:42,830 --> 00:48:44,374
Chester , stop it .

504
00:48:45,375 --> 00:48:46,752
Chester , stop it !

505
00:48:48,797 --> 00:48:49,882
Stop it , Chester !

506
00:48:50,967 --> 00:48:52,761
Stop it , Chester !

507
00:49:48,884 --> 00:49:50,470
Tan ?

508
00:49:54,225 --> 00:49:55,978
Are you Tan ?

509
00:50:07,829 --> 00:50:09,957
Hold his head .

510
00:50:36,996 --> 00:50:40,418
Kuah , the recruits can see you .

511
00:50:43,005 --> 00:50:45,967
Sir , it 's really bad this time . Trust me .

512
00:50:46,593 --> 00:50:47,845
So what are you suggesting ?

513
00:50:47,929 --> 00:50:49,932
I think we should call in a medium .

514
00:50:50,015 --> 00:50:52,519
Medium ? Are you serious ?

515
00:50:52,602 --> 00:50:54,897
Yes , Sir . I know a very popular medium .

516
00:50:55,523 --> 00:50:57,860
Kuah , do you realise what you 're saying ?

517
00:50:57,943 --> 00:51:00,572
You want to call in a medium to perform a ritual ?

518
00:51:00,948 --> 00:51:02,325
Sir , it 's not about performing any ritual .

519
00:51:02,408 --> 00:51:04,411
The medium will just be here to take a look .

520
00:51:04,494 --> 00:51:07,081
Just to take a look ? Does this look like a joke to you ?

521
00:51:07,415 --> 00:51:09,293
What kind of signals are you sending to the recruits ?

522
00:51:09,376 --> 00:51:10,420
That this camp is haunted ?

523
00:51:10,503 --> 00:51:12,005
The recruits are not blind .

524
00:51:12,089 --> 00:51:14,300
Having seen Chester 's behaviour , they know what 's going on .

525
00:51:14,384 --> 00:51:18,056
Look . It 's obvious they 're not taking Tan 's death very well .

526
00:51:18,139 --> 00:51:20,643
They 're mentally and emotionally disturbed . I get it .

527
00:51:21,227 --> 00:51:22,896
You 're the platoon sergeant .

528
00:51:22,980 --> 00:51:25,108
You should be looking into this sort of things .

529
00:51:25,191 --> 00:51:29,030
Sir , Chester didn 't lose his mind . I 'm serious . Trust me , okay ?

530
00:51:29,739 --> 00:51:31,242
I 've trusted you before .

531
00:51:35,498 --> 00:51:39,671
Sir , I know you blame me for Lye and Tan 's deaths , right ?

532
00:51:41,256 --> 00:51:43,969
Tan 's death is still under investigation .

533
00:51:44,678 --> 00:51:46,514
Don 't go there .

534
00:51:46,597 --> 00:51:49,226
But as for Lye , he committed suicide .

535
00:51:49,310 --> 00:51:51,187
You know that , I know that .

536
00:51:51,271 --> 00:51:52,648
We could 've saved him had you sent him

537
00:51:52,731 --> 00:51:54,901
for counselling much earlier .

538
00:51:54,985 --> 00:51:56,695
Okay , Sir . It was all my fault .

539
00:51:57,196 --> 00:51:59,157
It was all my fault that Lye and Tan died , okay ?

540
00:51:59,491 --> 00:52:00,534
But this time round

541
00:52:00,618 --> 00:52:02,913
I can 't let the same thing happen to my recruits again , Sir .

542
00:52:04,582 --> 00:52:05,959
Sorry , Sir .

543
00:52:06,042 --> 00:52:08,838
If you want to charge me and jail me in the detention barracks

544
00:52:08,922 --> 00:52:10,173
go ahead .

545
00:52:10,257 --> 00:52:12,260
This time round , I insist on calling in the medium .

546
00:52:13,136 --> 00:52:14,346
Sorry , Sir .

547
00:52:24,611 --> 00:52:26,364
- Sir . - Sir .

548
00:53:51,529 --> 00:53:53,073
Out of all the people here

549
00:53:53,157 --> 00:53:54,867
why was Chester the only one affected ?

550
00:53:55,869 --> 00:53:57,955
Maybe he was just down on his luck .

551
00:53:58,331 --> 00:54:00,793
Talking to you is like talking to a brick wall .

552
00:54:04,715 --> 00:54:07,010
Do you remember the night when Chester and Tan were on guard duty ?

553
00:54:07,094 --> 00:54:09,848
After that night , Tan became really timid .

554
00:54:10,891 --> 00:54:12,977
I dreamt of Tan after the mishap .

555
00:54:13,478 --> 00:54:15,522
And in my dream , Chester died .

556
00:54:16,107 --> 00:54:19,111
I believe he had something to do with Tan 's death .

557
00:54:42,645 --> 00:54:44,022
Are you okay ?

558
00:54:50,532 --> 00:54:51,700
Was it really Tan ?

559
00:54:56,457 --> 00:54:58,502
- What are you talking about ? - I 'm asking if it was Tan .

560
00:55:01,047 --> 00:55:03,426
- How would I know ? - Stop giving me that excuse .

561
00:55:03,801 --> 00:55:05,220
Tell me honestly .

562
00:55:05,303 --> 00:55:08,141
Did you have anything to do with Tan 's death ?

563
00:55:09,977 --> 00:55:11,020
No .

564
00:55:14,775 --> 00:55:16,027
When are you going to stop lying ?

565
00:55:17,237 --> 00:55:20,492
He was your good friend and my best friend too .

566
00:55:21,452 --> 00:55:23,413
He helped you so many times , which I 'm sure you 're aware of .

567
00:55:23,496 --> 00:55:24,957
Don 't you think you 've let him down ?

568
00:55:28,420 --> 00:55:33,469
Chester , tell me what you know . I 'll help you .

569
00:56:08,520 --> 00:56:10,523
Why did you bring me here ?

570
00:56:15,823 --> 00:56:19,954
That night , when Tan and I were on guard duty ...

571
00:56:21,873 --> 00:56:24,836
Chester , how did we get here ?

572
00:56:24,919 --> 00:56:26,755
Are we lost ?

573
00:56:26,839 --> 00:56:28,591
Don 't worry .

574
00:56:28,675 --> 00:56:31,679
We should be able to find a way out if we head in that direction .

575
00:56:31,762 --> 00:56:33,348
Let 's go .

576
00:56:34,767 --> 00:56:36,186
What 's wrong ?

577
00:56:36,269 --> 00:56:38,731
- I 've got a cramp in my leg . - What 's your problem now ?

578
00:56:38,814 --> 00:56:40,400
We still have to hurry to the next checkpoint .

579
00:56:41,694 --> 00:56:43,738
I really can 't go on .

580
00:56:44,281 --> 00:56:47,160
I 'll take a look around . You can take a rest here .

581
00:57:36,064 --> 00:57:37,525
Chester !

582
00:57:37,608 --> 00:57:40,237
Chester , something 's grabbing my leg !

583
00:58:01,769 --> 00:58:05,441
It didn 't look human .

584
00:58:05,524 --> 00:58:08,403
What do you mean ? Think carefully .

585
00:58:08,487 --> 00:58:11,449
- Was there blood or ... - I really don 't know .

586
00:58:13,703 --> 00:58:17,959
I panicked and couldn 't see clearly .

587
00:58:19,920 --> 00:58:21,672
Where did it happen ?

588
00:58:27,973 --> 00:58:29,684
Just down the slope .

589
00:58:30,936 --> 00:58:32,689
Let 's go down and search around .

590
00:58:38,572 --> 00:58:40,199
Jeremy .

591
00:58:40,867 --> 00:58:42,286
It happened here .

592
00:59:03,901 --> 00:59:05,653
Let 's continue searching .

593
00:59:21,635 --> 00:59:23,387
What 's wrong ?

594
00:59:26,851 --> 00:59:28,103
Did you see her ?

595
00:59:29,229 --> 00:59:30,857
Who ?

596
00:59:31,190 --> 00:59:33,277
She was just standing here .

597
00:59:37,491 --> 00:59:39,452
There 's no one else here .

598
00:59:40,078 --> 00:59:41,747
I 'm sure she had something to do with Tan 's death .

599
00:59:45,378 --> 00:59:46,922
I 'm sure it 's her .

600
00:59:48,340 --> 00:59:49,926
Jeremy .

601
00:59:50,552 --> 00:59:51,804
Are you all right ?

602
00:59:51,887 --> 00:59:53,807
I must find her .

603
00:59:55,267 --> 00:59:57,145
Let 's return to the company line first .

604
00:59:57,228 --> 00:59:59,315
- Come on . - Chester .

605
01:00:01,359 --> 01:00:03,571
You could be the next fatality .

606
01:00:04,864 --> 01:00:06,867
What are you talking about ?

607
01:00:07,744 --> 01:00:09,872
I dreamt of you dying .

608
01:00:11,165 --> 01:00:12,834
Dream ?

609
01:00:12,918 --> 01:00:15,004
It was only a dream .

610
01:00:17,216 --> 01:00:21,597
Before Tan died , I dreamt of his demise too .

611
01:00:23,475 --> 01:00:25,937
Both dreams were exactly the same .

612
01:00:29,150 --> 01:00:31,278
I 've got to find that woman .

613
01:00:33,740 --> 01:00:36,369
I believe the villagers on this island should know her .

614
01:00:44,213 --> 01:00:45,882
Excuse me .

615
01:00:46,508 --> 01:00:49,304
You grew up on this island , didn 't you ?

616
01:00:49,388 --> 01:00:50,848
Yes . Why ?

617
01:00:51,265 --> 01:00:53,310
There 's a legend about a medium on this island .

618
01:00:53,393 --> 01:00:55,146
Is that true ?

619
01:00:56,565 --> 01:00:58,776
- I don 't know . - I believe you do .

620
01:00:58,860 --> 01:01:01,781
This is very important to us . Please tell us .

621
01:01:03,074 --> 01:01:04,660
She has killed a friend of mine .

622
01:01:06,788 --> 01:01:08,499
I really don 't know .

623
01:01:08,958 --> 01:01:11,336
He may be the next fatality .

624
01:01:12,838 --> 01:01:14,925
He 'll die if you don 't tell us the truth .

625
01:01:16,260 --> 01:01:18,179
Please help us .

626
01:01:19,139 --> 01:01:20,767
All right ?

627
01:01:26,358 --> 01:01:28,361
I saw her when I was a kid .

628
01:01:28,444 --> 01:01:31,115
- Go to hell . - Go to hell .

629
01:01:31,198 --> 01:01:34,328
- Freak ! - Get lost !

630
01:01:34,411 --> 01:01:35,580
Go away !

631
01:01:36,331 --> 01:01:40,587
One by one , the kids in the village started dying .

632
01:01:40,671 --> 01:01:42,924
Everyone believed that it was Madam Yi

633
01:01:43,007 --> 01:01:44,217
who placed a curse on the kids

634
01:01:44,718 --> 01:01:47,597
so as to seek revenge for her daughter .

635
01:01:50,935 --> 01:01:52,312
But I couldn 't be sure .

636
01:01:53,606 --> 01:01:58,113
Looking at her , I could sense her fury and viciousness .

637
01:01:59,448 --> 01:02:02,077
She seemed to have a strange supernatural ability

638
01:02:02,160 --> 01:02:04,330
to control other people .

639
01:02:06,834 --> 01:02:09,045
Is she still living on the island ?

640
01:02:09,755 --> 01:02:11,507
I haven 't seen her in a long time .

641
01:02:11,591 --> 01:02:14,094
But according to some villagers who saw her recently

642
01:02:14,178 --> 01:02:16,347
she has gone insane .

643
01:02:16,806 --> 01:02:18,559
Do you know where she lives ?

644
01:02:18,893 --> 01:02:22,607
On the north side of this island somewhere near the river .

645
01:02:23,566 --> 01:02:25,694
Let 's talk to Sergeant Kuah .

646
01:02:26,195 --> 01:02:27,614
Thank you .

647
01:02:59,410 --> 01:03:00,954
Chester .

648
01:03:02,707 --> 01:03:04,292
Chester .

649
01:03:08,298 --> 01:03:09,925
Chester !

650
01:03:23,320 --> 01:03:24,989
Chester !

651
01:03:28,703 --> 01:03:30,330
Chester !

652
01:07:00,928 --> 01:07:02,890
Do you believe now ?

653
01:07:03,182 --> 01:07:05,226
Stop .

654
01:07:05,310 --> 01:07:07,188
Don 't be afraid .

655
01:07:11,277 --> 01:07:12,946
Help me .

656
01:07:13,029 --> 01:07:15,032
Help me !

657
01:07:20,415 --> 01:07:22,501
Why did you have to kill them ?

658
01:07:23,586 --> 01:07:24,797
That was just an accident .

659
01:07:29,345 --> 01:07:30,555
I didn 't kill them .

660
01:07:34,018 --> 01:07:35,354
So who did ?

661
01:09:27,600 --> 01:09:29,645
I 'm sorry .

662
01:09:36,989 --> 01:09:39,868
I 've let you down .

663
01:11:08,038 --> 01:11:10,750
I 'm sorry .

664
01:11:14,047 --> 01:11:17,552
I 've let you down .

665
01:13:36,546 --> 01:13:37,714
Darn .

666
01:13:38,716 --> 01:13:41,428
We 're stuck here for this weekend .

667
01:13:41,512 --> 01:13:43,139
Don 't get me started .

668
01:13:43,222 --> 01:13:46,185
My girlfriend 's going to be peeved again .

669
01:13:53,112 --> 01:13:57,034
Have you heard about the history of this island ?

670
01:13:58,369 --> 01:14:00,289
What history ?

671
01:14:00,664 --> 01:14:03,752
It was said that there were two recruits

672
01:14:03,836 --> 01:14:07,424
who accidentally killed a villager while performing guard duties .

673
01:14:08,634 --> 01:14:10,888
Were there villagers on this island ?

674
01:14:10,971 --> 01:14:13,725
Of course . Didn 't you study history ?

675
01:14:13,809 --> 01:14:15,353
There used to be many villagers on this island .

676
01:14:16,688 --> 01:14:20,109
That villager 's spirit came back and took revenge on the two recruits .

677
01:14:20,819 --> 01:14:25,534
Every night at 23.59 , she would return to haunt them .

678
01:14:30,249 --> 01:14:31,793
Are you sure ?

679
01:14:31,877 --> 01:14:34,255
Do you think I would joke about something like this ?

680
01:14:34,338 --> 01:14:35,423
Give me a break .

681
01:14:35,507 --> 01:14:39,930
That story happened so long ago . I can confirm it was just a rumour .

682
01:14:40,931 --> 01:14:42,642
Do you know why I can confirm it 's true ?

683
01:14:42,726 --> 01:14:44,520
Why ?

684
01:14:44,603 --> 01:14:46,773
It was my uncle who told me .

685
01:14:47,566 --> 01:14:49,486
- Who is your uncle ? - Who is your uncle ?

686
01:14:50,028 --> 01:14:51,614
He 's the commander of this camp .

687
01:14:52,991 --> 01:14:54,952
- Our commander ? - Our commander ?

